Add opt-in `--translation-cache`, a bounded process-local translation table over
semantic module keys. It reuses the default module-local translator's immutable
snapshots and prepares fresh proof tasks, without changing names, resolution
scheduling or solver inputs. Separate CLI processes share no table. No disk
translation cache or verification-result cache is enabled by this option.
Translation reuse is bypassed for modular termination until its post-global
view is keyed, and for counterexample extraction until report state has a codec.
It requires `--type-system-refresh`; legacy-type-system requests fail option validation with exit code 2.
